    "Stem": "Meridian Medical Devices is developing a new surgical stapler for the U.S. hospital market. Market research indicates that competing products sell for $180 per unit. Meridian's management has set a target profit margin of 25% of selling price. Under target costing, what is the maximum allowable manufacturing cost per unit?",
