    "Stem": "Bridgewater Chemicals sells an industrial solvent at $50 per gallon. The company is considering a 15% price increase. Market research estimates the price elasticity of demand for this product at -2.0. What is the expected percentage change in quantity demanded and the resulting impact on total revenue?",
